# Repository and local tooling state
**/.git
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.rsuser

# Generated files and dependencies restored inside the build
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
**/TestResults
**/artifacts
**/coverage
**/*.log

# Credentials never belong in an image layer
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets.json
**/secrets.*.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/appsettings.*.Local.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/DataProtection-Keys

# Documentation and local orchestration are not build inputs
docs
scripts
README.md
**/docker-compose*
**/Dockerfile*
